    {
      "id": "probability-039",
      "sha256": "5d3a3ff686b0f89c013291b0dcf6c9bb1317e9538bfe4293821f87e53c243941",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 321,
      "raw": "联合概率的不等式带给我们一个有趣的比率：\n$0 \\leq \\frac{P(A=a, B=b)}{P(A=a)} \\leq 1$。\n我们称这个比率为*条件概率*（conditional probability），\n并用$P(B=b \\mid A=a)$表示它：它是$B=b$的概率，前提是$A=a$已发生。",
      "math": {
        "expected": 4,
